@startuml
[*] --> MonitoringNotifications
MonitoringNotifications -> SendingNotification : Notification level reaches threshold
SendingNotification -> ViewingNotifications : User clicks "View Notifications"
SendingNotification -> ClearingNotifications : User clicks "Clear Notifications"
SendingNotification -> UpdatingNotificationSettings : User clicks "Notification Settings"
ViewingNotifications --> MonitoringNotifications : View notifications completed
ClearingNotifications --> MonitoringNotifications : Clear notifications completed
UpdatingNotificationSettings --> MonitoringNotifications : Update settings completed
MonitoringNotifications --> [*]
@enduml
